        "description": "Current Human Owner and initialized active Agent. Includes disabled configuration. Each page observes Agent version and the complete validated assignment set in one committed transaction. SkillID ascending; signed cursor binds user, Project, Agent, limit and assignment sequence. Sequence drift returns CURSOR_STALE. Agent version is current per page, not a cross-page snapshot. Total 2s including actual HTTP/SQL cleanup; no body, duplicate/unknown query or bare question mark.",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 100,
              "default": 25
